 f Tampas ADA Coordinator at least 48 hours prior to the proceeding. The AD
 A Coordinator may be contacted via phone at 813-274-3964\, email at TampaA
 DAtampagov.net\, or by submitting an ADA - Accommodations Request form ava
 ilable online at https:tampa.govADARequest (https:tampa.govADARequest). Fo
 r additional information\, please contact the Clerks Office at 813-274-839
 7 or at CityClerkStafftampagov.net (mailto:CityClerkStafftampagov.net). \n
