 ion: City Center at Hanna Avenue 2555 E. Hanna Ave. Tampa FL 33610 Tampa F
 orward: Building Tomorrow Together is a two-year project to update the Cit
 ys Land Development Code (LDC). A Public Meeting to discuss Installment Tw
 o of the Citys updated LDC will be held on Thursday\, October 29\, 2026\, 
 from 6:30 p.m. to 8:30 p.m. at the City Center at Hanna Avenue (2555 East 
